lmont. Live at Short's release: sentence 1 title Live at Short's 2005. MTV Unplugged 2.0 release: sentence 0 title MTV Unplugged 2.0. Platinum certification: sentence 3. Chart peaked: sentence 5. Rooftops and Invitations release: sentence 2 title Rooftops and Invitations. Don't Wait release: sentence 3 title Don't Wait.\n\nNow craft answer: \"Escanaba Firing Line is a Michigan rock band formed in 2002 that has issued limited‑edition live albums such as Live at Short’s (2006) and Live at The Belmont (2010), both released in limited quantities and offered as free downloads, whereas Dashboard Confessional is a different American rock act whose 2002 live album MTV Unplugged 2.0 was certified platinum and charted on Billboard, and whose singles “Rooftops and Invitations” and “Don’t Wait” were released to radio in 2006.\"\n\nProvide citations accordingly.\n\nList citations as pairs: [\"Escanaba Firing Line\",0], [\"Live at Short's 2005\",1], [\"Live at the Belmont\",1], [\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\",0], [\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\",3], [\"MTV Unplugged 2.0\",5], [\"Rooftops and Invitations\",2], [\"Don't Wait (Dashboard Confessional song)\",3].\n\nReturn JSON."},"finish_reason":"stop"}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":1342,"completion_tokens":775,"total_tokens":2117,"audio_prompt_tokens":0},"created":1791970205,"object":"chat.completion","prompt_filter_results":null}